                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.151/141: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Greece</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Aldridge</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-07-11T14:00:00+02:00">July 11, 1935—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received July 11—10 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>94. Department’s 45, July 5, 7 p.m. I have seen Mr. Tsaldaris, Prime Minister and
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs. He promised me to give the matter his personal
                    attention.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Aldridge</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
